// pce-practice-demo — vertex DDL (31 vertices)
// Source: docs/spec/SCHEMA_SPEC.md §1 (18 source-loaded) + §2 (13 app-written)
// Target: TigerGraph 4.2.2, GSQL Syntax V1. Run in global scope before 02_edges.gsql.
USE GLOBAL

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// §1 Source-loaded vertices (18)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

